{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2022-04-06 16:45:00', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SIRONA ANNOUNCES APPOINTMENT OF MR. JOHN P. GROETELAARS AS NEW BOARD MEMBER', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., APRIL 06, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- \xa0DENTSPLY SIRONA INC. (“DENTSPLY SIRONA”) (NASDAQ: XRAY)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MR. JOHN P. GROETELAARS HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE “BOARD”), INCREASING THE SIZE OF ITS BOARD FROM ELEVEN TO TWELVE MEMBERS.'}